<title>USA: Perini Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Perini Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.37     loss	 $6.61</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,311     loss	30,674</p>
<p> Oper Revs		340,670		  232,974</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     4,847,187		4,718,873</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.88     loss	 $6.58</p>
<p> Net profit		 5,822     loss	28,916</p>
<p> Oper Revs		927,191		  803,024</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     4,785,264		4,635,511</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The three and nine month periods in 1995 include a charge, which aggregated $25.6 million, to provide reserves for a previously disclosed litigation in Washington D.C. and downward revisions in estimated probable recoveries on certain outstanding contract claims.</p>
</text>
